window.__CAPM_DATA=(window.__CAPM_DATA||"")+"\\\"/><\\/h1>\"},{\"part\":21,\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s88N-1\\\">Full Mock Exam 3 - Result Sheet<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s666\\\">Assign “1” point to each question answered correctly, and then count your points to get your final score.<\\/p><h1 class=\\\"heading_s2WK\\\"><img alt=\\\"Source figure\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\\\"/><\\/h1>\"},{\"part\":24,\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s88N-1\\\">Full Mock Exam 4 - Result Sheet<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s666\\\">Assign “1” point to each question answered correctly, and then count your points to get your final score.<\\/p><h1 class=\\\"heading_s2WK\\\"><img alt=\\\"Source figure\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" src=\\\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\\\"/><\\/h1>\"},{\"part\":25,\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s88N-3\\\">About The Author<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\">Yassine Tounsi is a seasoned Project Management expert, best-selling Author, and PMI Authorized Trainer, with an experience of over 12 years in leading projects across various industries. Yassine is a Project Management Professional (PMP)® as well as a Construction Professional in Built Environment Projects (PMI-CP)™.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\">Yassine is an accomplished author, having written several books covering multiple project management topics, with over 10,000 copies sold since 2021. Yassine's dedication to sharing knowledge extends to creating online courses on renowned learning platforms such as Udemy, where his courses have over 24k students enrolled.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\">As the Founder &amp; CEO of Three Moves Consulting, Yassine develops and conducts Project management training for professionals worldwide. He also develops customized educational content for global partners such as the University of Phoenix and the Institute of Project Management (IPM).<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\">Apart from being a writer and trainer, Yassine has held various project management positions ranging from construction Project Management, where he oversaw the construction of commercial and residential properties, to IT Project Management, where he successfully led web &amp; mobile applications, ERP, and data science projects.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-1\\\">Armed with a rich and diverse practical experience, Yassine also consults individuals and organizations on a broad spectrum of topics, helping project managers and their teams across the world develop practical skills and find more effective and resilient ways of managing and delivering projects, as well as leading people.<\\/p>\"},{\"part\":26,\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"class_s803\\\">Copyright© Yassine Tounsi.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s803\\\">All rights reserved.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-0\\\">The information in this material is aligned with the Project Management Institute, A Guide to the Project Management Body of Knowledge, (PMBOK® Guide) 7th Edition, Project Management Institute.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-0\\\">This is a commercial confidential document. All rights reserved. No part of this publication may be reproduced, distributed, or transmitted in any form or by any means, including photocopying, recording, or other electronic or mechanical methods, without the prior written permission of the publisher, except in the case of brief quotations embodied in critical reviews and certain other noncommercial uses permitted by copyright law.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s80-0\\\">CAPM® is a registered trademark of the Project Management Institute, Inc. “PMI” is a service and trademark of the Project Management Institute, Inc. which is registered in the United States and other nations. “PMBOK” is a trademark of the Project Management Institute, Inc. which is registered in the United States and other nations.<\\/p><p class=\\\"class_s809\\\">For permission requests, contact: contact@yassinetounsi.co<span><\\/span>m<\\/p>\"}],\"issues\":1}";
